# Cultivation — iron scythe item sprite (16px native).
# Silhouette shared by the scythe tier family: a thin wooden snath running the
# bottom-left -> upper-right diagonal with a short grip peg, and a curved iron
# blade sweeping left across the top, curling down to a point at the left.
# Blade: light-grey iron ramp with a bright cutting edge along the concave
# underside and a dark socket at the heel. Wood: warm brown ramp, lit top-left.
size: 16
kind: sprite
ships: src/main/resources/assets/cultivation/textures/item/iron_scythe.png

legend:
  . transparent
  K ink          # #0a0a0a outline
  b #a5793f      # wood rim highlight (snath top)
  h #8a5a2b      # wood light
  w #6b4420      # wood mid
  d #4a2f14      # wood dark (butt / grip peg)
  E #ececec      # iron cutting-edge glint
  L #d8d8d8      # iron light
  M #a8a8a8      # iron mid
  D #707070      # iron dark
  S #4f4f4f      # iron core shadow (socket)

